---
// Reusable "work in progress" banner for pillar pages still being built.
// Drop <UnderConstruction /> near the top of a pillar's MDX. Pass child content
// to override the default message.
---

<aside
  class="not-prose my-6 flex items-start gap-3 rounded-md border border-dashed border-rule-strong bg-well p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-muted"
>
  <span class="stamp mt-0.5">Draft</span>
  <p>
    <slot
      >This page is still being built, so sections may be incomplete or change
      as it's fleshed out. The calculators are sourced and tested; treat the
      surrounding content as a work in progress.</slot
    >
  </p>
</aside>
